\taxon{Remark}
\title{How we type replay selection}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{replay}

\p{We formulate a persistent pool and a separate annotation step to make the
reuse recursion explicit. DGG in
\citet{Section 3; Section 5 and Algorithm 1}{miao2026when} recomputes policy ratios
and a gradient diagnostic while reusing a rollout batch. Those quantities
depend on the current policy and therefore belong to the attempted update
rather than the historical record.}

\p{The split also exposes the cost of selecting, scoring, and rejecting reused
records.}
